  "solution": "$$\\vec{s} = (4 - 1)\\hat{i} + (-1 - 2)\\hat{j} + (3 - 0)\\hat{k} = 3\\hat{i} - 3\\hat{j} + 3\\hat{k}$$\n$$W = \\vec{F}\\cdot\\vec{s} = 6 - 9 - 3 = -6\\ \\text{J}$$",
